#: ErrorMessageConfigDialog.cpp:56
msgid "Configure error messages"
msgstr "設定錯誤訊息"

#: ErrorMessageConfigDialog.cpp:78
msgid ""
"<p>Here you may select files to use instead of the default error messages "
"passed to a client.</p><p>The files may contain anything you wish, but by "
"convention you should report the error code and the English version of the "
"error message (e.g. \"Bad request\"). Your file should also be valid HTML.</"
"p><p>The strings ERROR_MESSAGE, ERROR_CODE and RESOURCE, if they exist in "
"the file, will be replaced with the English error message, the numeric error "
"code and the path of the requested resource, respectively.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>在這裡您可能選擇檔案來用於代替傳給客戶端的預設錯誤訊息。</p><p>這些檔案可"
"包含任何您想要的東西，但依慣例您應該回報錯誤碼和錯誤訊息的英文版本（例如："
"「Bad Request」）。您的檔案也應該是有效的 HTML 格式。</p><p>如果字串 "
"ERROR_MESSAGE 、 ERROR_CODE 和 RESOURCE 存在於檔案中，將會被英文錯誤訊息，數"
"值錯誤碼和要求資源路徑，各別地替代。</p>"

#: ErrorMessageConfigDialog.cpp:114
#, qt-format
msgid "%1 %2"
msgstr "%1 %2"

#: Help.cpp:38
msgid ""
"<p>Specify the name that will be used when announcing this server on network."
"</p>"
msgstr "<p>指定用於公佈在網絡上的伺服器名稱。</p>"

#: Help.cpp:41
msgid ""
"<p>The Zeroconf daemon is not running. See the Handbook for more information."
"<br/>Other users will not see this system when browsing the network via "
"zeroconf, but sharing will still work.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Zeroconf 系統程式未有執行。請看手冊以獲得更多資訊。<br/>其他使用者在使用 "
"zeroconf 瀏覽網絡時將不會見到此系統，但分享仍然有效。</p>"

#: Help.cpp:46
msgid ""
"<p>Zeroconf support is not available in this version of KDE. See the "
"Handbook for more information.<br/>Other users will not see this system when "
"browsing the network via zeroconf, but sharing will still work.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>本版本的 KDE 不支援 Zeroconf 。請看手冊以獲得更多資訊。<br/>其他使用者在使"
"用 zeroconf 瀏覽網絡時將不會見到此系統，但分享仍然有效。</p>"

#: Help.cpp:51
msgid ""
"<p>Unknown error with Zeroconf.<br/>Other users will not see this system "
"when browsing the network via zeroconf, but sharing will still work.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Zeroconf 發生未知的問題。<br/>其他使用者在使用 zeroconf 瀏覽網絡時將不會見"
"到此系統，但分享仍然有效。</p>"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:189
msgid "&Sharing"
msgstr "分享(&S)"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:288
msgid ""
"<p>To share files via the web, you need to be running an 'applet' in your "
"KDE panel. This 'applet' is a small program which provides file sharing "
"capabilities.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<P>要經網絡分享檔案，您要在 KDE 面版上執行『小程式』。這個『小程式』是提供檔"
"案分享的小型程式。"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:298
msgid "Start Applet"
msgstr "開動小程式"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:305 PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:576
msgid "Applet status: <strong>not running</strong>"
msgstr "小程式狀態：<strong>沒有執行</strong>"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:328
msgid "Share this directory on the &Web"
msgstr "在網絡上分享這個目錄(&W)"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:362
msgid "kB/s"
msgstr "kB/秒"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:393
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"<p>Setting this option makes all files in this directory and any "
"subdirectories available for reading to anyone who wishes to view them.</"
"p><p>To view your files, a web browser or similar program may be used.</"
"p><p><strong>Warning!</strong> Before sharing a directory, you should be "
"sure that it does not contain sensitive information, such as passwords, "
"company secrets, your addressbook, etc.</p><p>Note that you cannot share "
"your home directory (%1)</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>設定這個選項會使得在此目錄，以及其子目錄中的所有檔案被任何想讀取得人取得。"
"</p><p>要檢視您的檔案，可使用網頁瀏覽器或類似的程式。</p><p><strong>警告！</"
"strong>在分享目錄之前，您應該確定其中並沒有敏感的資訊，像是密碼、公司機密、您"
"的通訊錄，等等。</p><p>注意：您不可以分享您的家目錄（%1）</p>"

#: PropertiesDialogPlugin.cpp:449
msgid ""
"<p>Allow serving of files which have a symbolic link in the path from / to "
"the file, or are a symbolic link themselves.</p><p><strong>Warning!</strong> "
"This could be a security risk. Use only if you understand the issues "
"involved.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>允許自檔案路徑 / 而來的符號連結，或符號連結本身的檔案服務。</p><p><strong>"
"警告！</strong>這可能有安全上的風險。只在您了解牽涉的問題時才可使用。</p>"

